#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_part.rst:5
msgid "Select one part"
msgstr "选择单个部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_part.rst:7
msgid ""
"At QElectroTech, one `part`_ (`Line`_, `Rectangle`_, `Ellipse`_, `Arc`_, "
"`Polygon`_, `Terminal`_, `text`_ and `dynamic text field`_) from the "
"`workspace`_ can be selected by a simple left click on the `part`_."
msgstr ""
"在 QElectroTech 中，只需在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中的某个 `部件 <part_>`_ （`线条 "
"<Line_>`_、`矩形 <Rectangle_>`_、`椭圆 <Ellipse_>`_、`圆弧 <Arc_>`_、`多边形 "
"<Polygon_>`_、`端子 <Terminal_>`_、`文本 <text_>`_ 和 `动态文本字段 <dynamic text "
"field_>`_ ）上点击左键，即可选中该 `部件 <part_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/parts/select/select_part.rst:14
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element editor workspace"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元件编辑器工作区"
